/* DATA DESCRIPTION:
Citation:	Cobb, Alexander R; Harvey, Charles Franklin (2019): Specific yield from the Mendaram peat swamp in Brunei Darussalam [dataset]. PANGAEA, https://doi.org/10.1594/PANGAEA.908210, 
	In supplement to: Cobb, AR; Harvey, CF (2019): Scalar Simulation and Parameterization of Water Table Dynamics in Tropical Peatlands. Water Resources Research, 55(11), 9351-9377, https://doi.org/10.1029/2019WR025411
Abstract:	The specific yield knots are recorded along with their 95% confidence intervals. Details on how they were computed from the peat surface Laplacian and throughfall and water table time series are provided inCobb and Harvey (2019).
Keyword(s):	hydraulic conductivity; specific yield; throughfall; tropical peat swamp; water table
Further details:	README for Brunei peat swamp data (URI: https://store.pangaea.de/Publications/Cobb-Harvey_2019/README.pdf)
Parameter(s):	Water level [m] (WL) * PI: Cobb, Alexander R (https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3128-3002, alex.cobb@smart.mit.edu) * METHOD/DEVICE: Solinst Levelogger (URI: http://www.solinst.com/Prod/3001/3001.html)
	Specific yield function [m/s] (Spec yield func) * PI: Cobb, Alexander R (https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3128-3002, alex.cobb@smart.mit.edu)
